{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/251122f51973addc8a0f9d35b03df139.avif?t=1759280821\" width=616 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/4a8573973b7c3e4458132ddd65c2d8ca.avif?t=1759280821\" width=616 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/dc669ef6e57c34ea0214459a2a30bb83.poster.avif?t=1759280821\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/dc669ef6e57c34ea0214459a2a30bb83.webm?t=1759280821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/dc669ef6e57c34ea0214459a2a30bb83.mp4?t=1759280821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creatures have built their unique personalities from memory and emotion in Layerland. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They create their own ecosystem with their own rules and thoughts, just like human society.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/e4bb18bce5b4b880158d6375645831d8.avif?t=1759280821\" width=616 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/4320505af21d2be0d0376bcb13075845.poster.avif?t=1759280821\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/4320505af21d2be0d0376bcb13075845.webm?t=1759280821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/4320505af21d2be0d0376bcb13075845.mp4?t=1759280821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We love the \u2018enemy to friend\u2019 dynamic. Even if the player battles the creatures to the death, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >we can still be their friend if you catch the creature. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the casual talk to unique emotional responses, pets can be domesticated to be part of your life, to be your friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/19291efe73be38f7a4eecb5d7ebbae54.avif?t=1759280821\" width=616 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/a229ed7455da94633e025a6e5de2b41b.poster.avif?t=1759280821\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/a229ed7455da94633e025a6e5de2b41b.webm?t=1759280821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/a229ed7455da94633e025a6e5de2b41b.mp4?t=1759280821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/cf912eb75dfb3f4355c33422be0f7fa3.poster.avif?t=1759280821\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/cf912eb75dfb3f4355c33422be0f7fa3.webm?t=1759280821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/cf912eb75dfb3f4355c33422be0f7fa3.mp4?t=1759280821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pets will respond differently depending on emotional buildup and their unique personalities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What kind of personality will your pet have? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might expect one, but no one can truly guess until you catch them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/3bd35457a242b142b83fd287ff7e7169.avif?t=1759280821\" width=616 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/605661adc5592ca4daee79d18a77890a.poster.avif?t=1759280821\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/605661adc5592ca4daee79d18a77890a.webm?t=1759280821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/605661adc5592ca4daee79d18a77890a.mp4?t=1759280821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/db8621e4d59b5874eb780a07cb71c237.poster.avif?t=1759280821\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/db8621e4d59b5874eb780a07cb71c237.webm?t=1759280821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/db8621e4d59b5874eb780a07cb71c237.mp4?t=1759280821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Layer land, pets support players by using their unique talents to overcome challenges </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and make the world less frightening. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They help with tasks like foraging, cooking, and building, and contribute creatively </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >by sculpting, drawing, and filming. Every task can be automated!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their artistic creations become lasting parts of the ecosystem you build together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/f686ec99a14a5e7f536886f40de23f03.avif?t=1759280821\" width=616 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/8a9b28c436879d496cba3e5dc0935b1a.poster.avif?t=1759280821\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/8a9b28c436879d496cba3e5dc0935b1a.webm?t=1759280821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/8a9b28c436879d496cba3e5dc0935b1a.mp4?t=1759280821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own house, place furniture, and decorate a cozy home for you and your pets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Housing is a strategy, a core memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/637c5be32c9a3508ebc1223ed397aa2a.avif?t=1759280821\" width=616 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/e21f539b68b019007e552eb988c5a78d.poster.avif?t=1759280821\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/e21f539b68b019007e552eb988c5a78d.webm?t=1759280821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/e21f539b68b019007e552eb988c5a78d.mp4?t=1759280821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 kinds of pets are here, but that\u2019s just the beginning. Players can create entirely new pets </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >through the breeding system. Your name will be featured in the new pet\u2019s illustrated guide!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/d0dcb5e3a815c541232c429ecba7effd.avif?t=1759280821\" width=616 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/9a212204a938bc7e2d022e74cfe8b3a7.poster.avif?t=1759280821\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/9a212204a938bc7e2d022e74cfe8b3a7.webm?t=1759280821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/9a212204a938bc7e2d022e74cfe8b3a7.mp4?t=1759280821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Layerland exists in real time, even after you close the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your pets might need your help while you're offline!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay connected with your pet and keep an eye on your world through the Layertalk app.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/87c644e1ff2f4e91c755019980802968.avif?t=1759280821\" width=616 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/e2f73cb736f36fa9c15cfde8dd4ffcd7.poster.avif?t=1759280821\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/e2f73cb736f36fa9c15cfde8dd4ffcd7.webm?t=1759280821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/e2f73cb736f36fa9c15cfde8dd4ffcd7.mp4?t=1759280821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Layerland reflects the exact terrain of Earth through Cesium technology! Mountains, oceans, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and grassfields from the real world you\u2019ve only imagined exploring will become your playground in Layerland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/7470ebd8132c87818b866f6987786c9c.avif?t=1759280821\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/3aebaa0f1ed92bc20d5b099dc6d576bd.poster.avif?t=1759280821\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/3aebaa0f1ed92bc20d5b099dc6d576bd.webm?t=1759280821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/3aebaa0f1ed92bc20d5b099dc6d576bd.mp4?t=1759280821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invasion Gates can appear anywhere, anytime\u2014without warning! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether the monsters pouring through are a deadly threat or a rare opportunity </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >for valuable loot depends entirely on you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your base with fortifications built alongside your loyal pet, and claim precious rewards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > for your bravery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/e367bb11e04e45339ce7a33914de1382.avif?t=1759280821\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/2c1de1a7fcc3977a3d554cd932676927.poster.avif?t=1759280821\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/2c1de1a7fcc3977a3d554cd932676927.webm?t=1759280821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/2c1de1a7fcc3977a3d554cd932676927.mp4?t=1759280821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a true-to-scale Earth built from real satellite data! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dimensional rifts open gates that transport players to alternate worlds\u2014each with a completely different ecosystem, yet mapped to the same coordinates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3884970?t=1759280821","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/e61c539eeacf1d27e1c4e7f0ef7e52cc386db147/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759280821","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/52f3174b760520d01ba5d42ad4773cc4f289193e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759280821","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/52f3174b760520d01ba5d42ad4773cc4f289193e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759280821","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/251122f51973addc8a0f9d35b03df139.avif?t=1759280821\" width=616 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/4a8573973b7c3e4458132ddd65c2d8ca.avif?t=1759280821\" width=616 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/dc669ef6e57c34ea0214459a2a30bb83.poster.avif?t=1759280821\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/dc669ef6e57c34ea0214459a2a30bb83.webm?t=1759280821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/dc669ef6e57c34ea0214459a2a30bb83.mp4?t=1759280821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creatures have built their unique personalities from memory and emotion in Layerland. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They create their own ecosystem with their own rules and thoughts, just like human society.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/e4bb18bce5b4b880158d6375645831d8.avif?t=1759280821\" width=616 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/4320505af21d2be0d0376bcb13075845.poster.avif?t=1759280821\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/4320505af21d2be0d0376bcb13075845.webm?t=1759280821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/4320505af21d2be0d0376bcb13075845.mp4?t=1759280821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We love the \u2018enemy to friend\u2019 dynamic. Even if the player battles the creatures to the death, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >we can still be their friend if you catch the creature. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the casual talk to unique emotional responses, pets can be domesticated to be part of your life, to be your friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/19291efe73be38f7a4eecb5d7ebbae54.avif?t=1759280821\" width=616 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/a229ed7455da94633e025a6e5de2b41b.poster.avif?t=1759280821\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/a229ed7455da94633e025a6e5de2b41b.webm?t=1759280821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/a229ed7455da94633e025a6e5de2b41b.mp4?t=1759280821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/cf912eb75dfb3f4355c33422be0f7fa3.poster.avif?t=1759280821\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/cf912eb75dfb3f4355c33422be0f7fa3.webm?t=1759280821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/cf912eb75dfb3f4355c33422be0f7fa3.mp4?t=1759280821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pets will respond differently depending on emotional buildup and their unique personalities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What kind of personality will your pet have? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might expect one, but no one can truly guess until you catch them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/3bd35457a242b142b83fd287ff7e7169.avif?t=1759280821\" width=616 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/605661adc5592ca4daee79d18a77890a.poster.avif?t=1759280821\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/605661adc5592ca4daee79d18a77890a.webm?t=1759280821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/605661adc5592ca4daee79d18a77890a.mp4?t=1759280821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/db8621e4d59b5874eb780a07cb71c237.poster.avif?t=1759280821\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/db8621e4d59b5874eb780a07cb71c237.webm?t=1759280821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/db8621e4d59b5874eb780a07cb71c237.mp4?t=1759280821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Layer land, pets support players by using their unique talents to overcome challenges </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and make the world less frightening. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They help with tasks like foraging, cooking, and building, and contribute creatively </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >by sculpting, drawing, and filming. Every task can be automated!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their artistic creations become lasting parts of the ecosystem you build together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/f686ec99a14a5e7f536886f40de23f03.avif?t=1759280821\" width=616 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/8a9b28c436879d496cba3e5dc0935b1a.poster.avif?t=1759280821\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/8a9b28c436879d496cba3e5dc0935b1a.webm?t=1759280821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/8a9b28c436879d496cba3e5dc0935b1a.mp4?t=1759280821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own house, place furniture, and decorate a cozy home for you and your pets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Housing is a strategy, a core memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/637c5be32c9a3508ebc1223ed397aa2a.avif?t=1759280821\" width=616 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/e21f539b68b019007e552eb988c5a78d.poster.avif?t=1759280821\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/e21f539b68b019007e552eb988c5a78d.webm?t=1759280821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/e21f539b68b019007e552eb988c5a78d.mp4?t=1759280821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 kinds of pets are here, but that\u2019s just the beginning. Players can create entirely new pets </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >through the breeding system. Your name will be featured in the new pet\u2019s illustrated guide!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/d0dcb5e3a815c541232c429ecba7effd.avif?t=1759280821\" width=616 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/9a212204a938bc7e2d022e74cfe8b3a7.poster.avif?t=1759280821\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/9a212204a938bc7e2d022e74cfe8b3a7.webm?t=1759280821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/9a212204a938bc7e2d022e74cfe8b3a7.mp4?t=1759280821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Layerland exists in real time, even after you close the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your pets might need your help while you're offline!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay connected with your pet and keep an eye on your world through the Layertalk app.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/87c644e1ff2f4e91c755019980802968.avif?t=1759280821\" width=616 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/e2f73cb736f36fa9c15cfde8dd4ffcd7.poster.avif?t=1759280821\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/e2f73cb736f36fa9c15cfde8dd4ffcd7.webm?t=1759280821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/e2f73cb736f36fa9c15cfde8dd4ffcd7.mp4?t=1759280821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Layerland reflects the exact terrain of Earth through Cesium technology! Mountains, oceans, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and grassfields from the real world you\u2019ve only imagined exploring will become your playground in Layerland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/7470ebd8132c87818b866f6987786c9c.avif?t=1759280821\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/3aebaa0f1ed92bc20d5b099dc6d576bd.poster.avif?t=1759280821\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/3aebaa0f1ed92bc20d5b099dc6d576bd.webm?t=1759280821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/3aebaa0f1ed92bc20d5b099dc6d576bd.mp4?t=1759280821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invasion Gates can appear anywhere, anytime\u2014without warning! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether the monsters pouring through are a deadly threat or a rare opportunity </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >for valuable loot depends entirely on you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your base with fortifications built alongside your loyal pet, and claim precious rewards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > for your bravery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/e367bb11e04e45339ce7a33914de1382.avif?t=1759280821\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/2c1de1a7fcc3977a3d554cd932676927.poster.avif?t=1759280821\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/2c1de1a7fcc3977a3d554cd932676927.webm?t=1759280821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/2c1de1a7fcc3977a3d554cd932676927.mp4?t=1759280821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a true-to-scale Earth built from real satellite data! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dimensional rifts open gates that transport players to alternate worlds\u2014each with a completely different ecosystem, yet mapped to the same coordinates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["PUDDING Co. Ltd."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/515909c7ef86673da37337536d9846a5f43c8e91/header.jpg?t=1759280821","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3884970/1712621243/b0b0cb38a484941e802c46b6728476d2cb8f03e8/1757653361/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757656290","dash_h264":"https: